added:        2026-10-17 by salim-slimani (agent)
notes:        Editing workspace with Desert_Dunes.mp4 selected and its built-in Lumetri grade open in Effect Controls; Program monitor on the graded dunes frame; project bins, a multi-track timeline with transitions and markers, and the loudness meters. 1600x900. Every frame shown is FilmSweet's own procedurally generated demo media (crates/media/src/generators.rs); contains no third-party, Adobe or copyrighted footage. All UI icons are drawn in code; fonts are Inter and JetBrains Mono (OFL-1.1).
